  "generated_description": "<div class=\"mountain-description prose prose-stone max-w-none\">\n  <p><strong>North Schell Peak</strong> rises to 11,857 feet in Nevada. It has roughly 5,361 feet of topographic prominence. The North Schell Peak Trail is a 2.1-mile hike with about 1,975 feet of elevation gain. Nearby peaks include Mount Moriah, Wheeler Peak and Doso Doyabi. Trail data is sourced from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL); verify current conditions with the official land manager before you go.</p>\n</div>",
